      "description": "The Corgi U.S. Equities 15% Structured Buffer ETF - September Series (CSEP) is an exchange-traded fund that mostly invests in downside hedge alternatives. The fund seeks to provide investors with returns that generally match the price return (excluding dividends) of the Invesco QQQ TrustSM, Series 1, up to the upside cap of 18.60% while providing a buffer against the first 15% of Invesco QQQ TrustSM, Series 1 losses, over the period from September 1, 2026 to August 31, 2027. CSEP was launched on Sep 14, 2026 and is issued by Corgi.",
